    {
      "id": "pu7GV-PnROQK4LzAle92j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -811.5960548548484,
      "y": -344.42316083113406,
      "width": 878.67919921875,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 670999252,
      "version": 2539,
      "versionNonce": 408176994,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763985382636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There is no additional latency in inference!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe BA matrix is summed at inference to the model which now have the exact same \nparameter count as the initial checkpoint.\n\nIn swithching task the current BA matrix can be subtracted and replaced by another one.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There is no additional latency in inference!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe BA matrix is summed at inference to the model which now have the exact same \nparameter count as the initial checkpoint.\n\nIn swithching task the current BA matrix can be subtracted and replaced by another one.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
