      "text": "Matrix update expressiveness",
      "fontSize": 39.54285714285655,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Matrix update expressiveness",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IeyKOXKAr6TLbSfnpiNQU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -789.8206800108877,
      "y": -1120.8571345068174,
      "width": 982.2191162109375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 529002860,
      "version": 2290,
      "versionNonce": 1519456190,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763985266514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How expressive should the matrix update should be?\n\nThe value of \"r\", which defines the expressivenes of the uodate matrix, depends on how close is the\nnew task to the origianl trainng of the starting model.\n\n    Example 1: LLM-es --> LLM-it    ==> LoRA\n    Example 2: LLM-es --> LLM-cn   ==> Full fine-tune",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How expressive should the matrix update should be?\n\nThe value of \"r\", which defines the expressivenes of the uodate matrix, depends on how close is the\nnew task to the origianl trainng of the starting model.\n\n    Example 1: LLM-es --> LLM-it    ==> LoRA\n    Example 2: LLM-es --> LLM-cn   ==> Full fine-tune",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
