    {
      "id": "-YSzsfWoZ6JRx63RZAzbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 303.6222473496473,
      "y": -1078.9298027413238,
      "width": 1081.638916015625,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 308427372,
      "version": 2663,
      "versionNonce": 635191010,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763986434631,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Unsloth is a lightweight library for faster LLM fine-tuning, Unsloth team (Daniel and Michael)\nUnsloth works by overwriting some parts of the modeling code with optimized operations. By manually deriving \nbackpropagation steps and rewriting all Pytorch modules\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUnsloth is the product of expertise and dedication. Digging into the most used machine learning\nlibraries they find multiple small speeds up that together gave 2x speed ups in trainig",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Unsloth is a lightweight library for faster LLM fine-tuning, Unsloth team (Daniel and Michael)\nUnsloth works by overwriting some parts of the modeling code with optimized operations. By manually deriving \nbackpropagation steps and rewriting all Pytorch modules\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUnsloth is the product of expertise and dedication. Digging into the most used machine learning\nlibraries they find multiple small speeds up that together gave 2x speed ups in trainig",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
